OL,3,GNEWSAMan charged with murder over fatal
OL,4,AA1(M) crash
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man has been charged with murder
OL,7,Ffollowing a fatal collision on the
OL,8,FA1(M) in North Yorkshire.
OL,10,FA 22-year-old woman, from Newcastle,
OL,11,Fdied when a silver Ford Transit and a
OL,12,Fsilver Volkswagen Golf collided on the
OL,13,Fsouthbound carriageway on Sunday, in
OL,14,Fthe Barton area, north of Scotch
OL,15,FCorner.
OL,17,FNorth Yorkshire Police said Florin
OL,18,FChiriac, of Hampstead Road, Newcastle,
OL,19,Fhad been charged with murder, attempted
OL,20,Fgrievous bodily harm and dangerous
OL,21,Fdriving in relation to the crash.
OL,23,APub: 08-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
